# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# SharedArrayBuffer requires cross-origin isolation. Without these two
# headers the browser refuses to construct one and an Emscripten pthreads
# build cannot start at all -- the failure is a bare 'SharedArrayBuffer is
# not defined' with no hint about the cause.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# The engine binary is content-addressed by version, so it caches forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
